{"seq":3,"slug":"retention-downsampling","title":"保留策略与降采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/retention-downsampling","wordCount":1332,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"保留策略与降采样\">保留策略与降采样</h1><p>监控系统跑满一年后，你会发现 90% 的存储被「再也没人看过的秒级历史数据」占着。没人关心去年三月某一秒的 CPU 是 31% 还是 32%——那个粒度的价值早已蒸发。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/timeseries-characteristics\">时序数据的特征</a> 里「热度随时间衰减」的直接后果。保留策略负责让无价值的旧数据自动消失，降采样负责在删除前先把它压缩成低精度摘要保留趋势。两者配合，让存储成本随时间收敛而非无界膨胀。本篇讲清这套时序库特有的生命周期机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保留（retention）与降采样（downsampling）是时序数据生命周期的两个动作：降采样把高频原始点聚合成低频摘要（如秒级 → 分钟级 → 小时级），保留策略给每个精度层设定存活时长，到期整块删除。它们共同实现「近期高精度、远期低精度、最旧不留」的分层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始秒级数据流] --&gt; B[热层: 保留7天&lt;br/&gt;原始精度]&#10;  B --&gt; C[降采样为分钟级]&#10;  C --&gt; D[温层: 保留90天&lt;br/&gt;分钟精度摘要]&#10;  D --&gt; E[降采样为小时级]&#10;  E --&gt; F[冷层: 保留2年&lt;br/&gt;小时精度摘要]&#10;  F --&gt; G[到期: 整块删除]&#10;  B --&gt; H[7天后原始块过期删除]\">graph TD\n  A[原始秒级数据流] --&gt; B[热层: 保留7天&lt;br/&gt;原始精度]\n  B --&gt; C[降采样为分钟级]\n  C --&gt; D[温层: 保留90天&lt;br/&gt;分钟精度摘要]\n  D --&gt; E[降采样为小时级]\n  E --&gt; F[冷层: 保留2年&lt;br/&gt;小时精度摘要]\n  F --&gt; G[到期: 整块删除]\n  B --&gt; H[7天后原始块过期删除]</pre><p>下表给出一套典型的分层保留方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>保留时长</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热层</td>\n<td>原始（秒级）</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>告警评估、故障排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温层</td>\n<td>分钟级摘要</td>\n<td>90 天</td>\n<td>周/月趋势分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷层</td>\n<td>小时级摘要</td>\n<td>2 年</td>\n<td>容量规划、合规审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>整块删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"降采样-把精度换成寿命\">降采样：把精度换成寿命</h2><p>降采样把一个时间窗口内的多个原始点聚合成一个摘要点。关键在于：聚合不是只算一个均值,而要保留足够的统计量以支持后续多种查询。</p>\n<p>最佳实践是为每个原始指标存多个聚合：均值、最小值、最大值、计数、求和。这样后续既能算趋势（均值），也能查峰值（最大值），还能再聚合（计数和求和可继续合并，均值不能直接平均，需用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x} = \\frac{\\sum x_i}{\\sum n_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 重算）。</p>\n<p>设原始采样周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、降采样后周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_1 = k \\cdot \\Delta t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则点数缩减为原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。秒级降到分钟级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span>，存储立减约 98%（再算上多存几个聚合量，实际约省 90%）。这种缩减叠加 <a href=\"compression-tsdb\">时序压缩：Gorilla 与 Delta</a> 的位级压缩，长期存储成本可压到极低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保留策略-到期即删\">保留策略：到期即删</h2><p>保留策略给数据设定「保质期」。因为 <a href=\"columnar-timeseries\">列式与时序存储布局</a> 把数据按时间切成不可变块，过期删除退化为「找出时间范围全部早于阈值的块，删掉文件」——无需逐行删除、无碎片、近乎零成本。</p>\n<p>不同系统的表达方式各异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>InfluxDB 用保留策略（retention policy）绑定到数据库/桶，自动删过期数据。</li>\n<li>Prometheus 用 <code>--storage.tsdb.retention.time</code>（默认 15 天）控制本地保留，长期存储交给 remote write 到 Thanos、Mimir、Cortex 等。</li>\n<li>TimescaleDB 用数据保留策略（<code>add_retention_policy</code>）自动 drop 过期 chunk，配合连续聚合做降采样。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>各产品的具体能力对比见 <a href=\"../systems/tsdb-products\">产品：InfluxDB、Prometheus、TimescaleDB</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现方式-批处理-vs-连续\">实现方式：批处理 vs 连续</h2><p>降采样有两种落地路径。批处理式：定时任务（如每小时）扫描原始数据、计算聚合、写入摘要表，简单但有延迟且重复扫描。连续式：用 <a href=\"../query/continuous-queries\">连续查询与物化</a> 在数据摄取时增量维护摘要,新数据一来就更新对应窗口的聚合，无需重扫历史。</p>\n<p>下表对比两种方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>批处理降采样</th>\n<th>连续/物化降采样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>高（按调度周期）</td>\n<td>低（近实时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>重复扫描历史</td>\n<td>增量更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（需增量聚合引擎）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乱序数据处理</td>\n<td>易（重算整窗）</td>\n<td>难（需窗口刷新机制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现代系统多走连续式。TimescaleDB 的连续聚合（continuous aggregate）和 InfluxDB 的任务（task）都是这一思路的实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降采样的精度损失与取舍\">降采样的精度损失与取舍</h2><p>降采样不可逆——一旦把秒级聚成分钟级并删掉原始数据，就再也无法还原那一分钟内的瞬时尖峰（除非你专门存了 max）。所以聚合量的选择必须前瞻：只存均值会丢失峰值，对容量规划是致命的;存了 min/max/count/sum 则保留了大部分可用信息。</p>\n<p>一个常见错误是只存均值导致「毛刺被抹平」——一秒的流量峰值在分钟均值里被稀释看不见，事后排查容量打满时无据可查。因此对延迟、错误率这类「峰值即风险」的指标，务必在降采样时保留最大值乃至高分位摘要。分位数的近似聚合（如 t-digest、HDR histogram）让降采样后仍能估算 P99,这类高级聚合见 <a href=\"../query/query-aggregation\">时序查询与聚合窗口</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保留与降采样是时序库特有的生命周期机制，源于热度随时间衰减的本质规律。</li>\n<li>降采样把高频点聚合成低频摘要，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 缩减点数；保留策略给每层设存活期、到期整块删除。</li>\n<li>不可变时间块让过期删除退化为删文件，零碎片、近零成本。</li>\n<li>实现分批处理与连续两路，现代系统多用连续/物化方式做增量降采样。</li>\n<li>降采样不可逆，必须前瞻性地保留 min/max/count/sum 乃至分位摘要，否则峰值信息永久丢失。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保留策略与降采样","id":"保留策略与降采样"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"降采样：把精度换成寿命","id":"降采样-把精度换成寿命"},{"level":2,"text":"保留策略：到期即删","id":"保留策略-到期即删"},{"level":2,"text":"实现方式：批处理 vs 连续","id":"实现方式-批处理-vs-连续"},{"level":2,"text":"降采样的精度损失与取舍","id":"降采样的精度损失与取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时序压缩：Gorilla 与 Delta","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/compression-tsdb"},"next":{"title":"高吞吐摄取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/ingestion-pipeline"}}